A||||19||Carrolles||Fresh 3.4 vs. turbo 2.8?||||1||
Z||000000||Carrolles||06-06-2000||12:09 AM||||Anybody compared the performance of a fresh 3.4 to putting a turbo on a rebuilt 2.8?<P>Remanufactured 3.4s can be gotten for around $1700.  Turbo kits seem to run around $3000.<P>I'd like to keep the car streetable (meaning no wild turbo boost).||||reg||1
